WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:08.483
For a one-off, like a single talk that isn't part of a course, go to Library, then Content, and add a new item.

2
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.164
Give it a title, then paste the video link into the Media box.

3
00:00:27.054 --> 00:00:30.875
Downloads, like a worksheet or slides, go in Library resources.

4
00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.391
Add a label and the link.

5
00:00:38.274 --> 00:00:40.661
Library placement says where it lives.

6
00:00:40.661 --> 00:00:45.433
Standalone content means it stands on its own, outside any course or series.

7
00:00:47.022 --> 00:00:50.081
Check the access box to see who can open it, then publish.
